  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B5%90%EC%88%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%84-%EB%B9%9A%EB%8A%94-%EC%A4%91/1760), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61239632)\n\n“Do I have to teach this person?”  Do-kyung gave up on her dream of becoming a singer in front of a wall of talent.  A trainee with a charming voice appeared in front of her, working as her vocal trainer.  \"Why is the professor here…\"  Hee-won, who suffers from severe stage fright, is convinced that only Do-kyung can cure her illness.  And Hee-won, who fell in love with Do-kyung at first sight, is cautious about everything in the relationship between professor and student.  In the meantime, Do-kyung's disciple suddenly appeared.  Seoho, who has returned as the main idol vocalist, goes straight ahead with his younger cuteness to Dokyung, whom he has had a crush on for a long time... What choice will Hee-won, who is anxious alone, make!?",
